{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1421,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef3099bbf28ed3c5acd21c36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バンブーさんの剣道指南は難解で…\r\n『シュっと出る』『ガッと打つ』\r\nなど、感性も試されるのですよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "37802af3a912642404ebbff74fbe15f7710efc3f1035871b562b3f2c77548419",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:607f556f897f3fa662e68e8e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "すぅ～～、はあぁぁっ――！\r\n朝からハチマキを締めると、\r\n一層、気が引き締まりますね！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fc212c7437408d6ec2557348779c30100c5468f29a4e532b159ffeaddd76a65",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea53b921a6c90f15f4bb8315",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この格好で外で昼寝をしていたら、\r\n子どもが刀の飾りをいじってきて…\r\nふふっ…一緒に遊んであげました。",
      "source_fingerprint": "06eedba2f37e2e8eab5e03f46e45ae80c14b5b2cf53b509b3d41f385f656fa11",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b26a871c15c93c465e0cb1f5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この衣装、暗いところで光るので\r\n交通安全の効果もあるのですよ！\r\n夜のランニングにも精が出ます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b47a8eb9e91f24d1449e0894b7653a8b7f4061838c27d575adff7b5d982cfdb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a6b8a9010031f34c2fd955bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "春は実家の門下生も増えます。\r\n今年はこの衣装で演武を披露した\r\nせいか、大盛況のようでして…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b804ec36531e5930b2aeec22e9b7b293ec023fe2219ee36d2cf14296338ccaf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:588cfad661f06b9cc39790f6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この衣装、上着を脱げば\r\n水中でも戦えそうですね！\r\n1つプールで試してみましょうか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d307454750ebe11931e4ace6c05657ef1233c75117437fb9cd101b3d0852948f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a35f5d660136a35f9531f767",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スポーツの秋、トレーナー殿も\r\nチャンバラはいかがですか？\r\n童心に返って熱くなれますよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a8417b47d63226c5ca787fb133ad67422287ca7a8fe9243ab51f6b02827ecb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e33a45609a108bfbe15603a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬ならではの戦…雪合戦！\r\n刀でも拳でもない戦いにも\r\n果敢に挑んでみせますとも！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c11d053c6b9a0f772f81eb11e51d90253a74ac02e70f5ba67f940dbefec4fcc9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:045fe64880adb75acf836e39",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "洗練されていますね。\r\nさながら未来へ臨む武将…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "30157677934cdd8892a643be725f81d3822546c3f0515d5b4afdd1eb4a52a8db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1080df7a417b2df2c2c5f9fd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最先端の化学繊維でできている\r\nそうです。実に軽くて動きやすい！",
      "source_fingerprint": "07ad9d56fdb9b98a1b2eb7834b9dc45051b5876de98c41df917331c91e55e338",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60b0c30ae9bb47524f26b947",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "练习时间到了呢！\r\n立刻开始吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d159def3ce64c3a2df876ab2e43113630ad6fdb87532200452470111fc7ec35",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9b23f08ecce2c8bd8e00019",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いきます！",
      "source_fingerprint": "66b5f974c284f4ca1078269985507a4fed108a51fbb7be0065c762ada56e2078",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85c48757444b73b6db374049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让你久等了。\r\n热身运动与集中精神\r\n都已完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f5677ad57bd8dc5e945646076d7238954edd1c44ec5344f7fde79d3d91bedd23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a7807dda7e7f86744ea29ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了走上我所追求的道路──\r\n我要努力锻炼，\r\n全力以赴挑战……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff9eb4803c263a81a23ffa8937783c544ac2798132c51aff563fd029f6139d7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:105136daa3d035a390f124ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我一定要将身为竞技选手的精髓\r\n磨练到极致！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5febba296c63a037c4606b76fbc01408a6d292bf28c3f6e830a7f5db68283bad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40ecf0c2bb161b649e3fdefe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "互为师、互为徒，\r\n让我们互相切磋琢磨吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "996c3f10cd8c95c1089a49a2c16b7935db6d1b7d1bc664d620340f60a55d3f01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d63ec78f894f1bd737dc64b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "训练员，吾师。\r\n无论面对什么考验，\r\n我都一定会克服！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a0e781897c992e8dd666ccd148df225448a9e9d37789b14aca31c64f28587aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:02c4089afc8871ae5931920e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我深信，只要是与你同行，\r\n就决不会走错路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc357fa2cf54891f2219388b5ce4c7ee1ca21c783446644b6672ddc9384f9125",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b51e2495ee839f6bb3c4ca4e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跑步时不易踩稳的沙滩……\r\n在这里练跑会是不错的修行呢。\r\n再来就只差铁木屐了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "93048490edd35c469f55003e85c4ebdb6c17e2ed860b50a476e56e243ca98e96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a1beb0da81a6ad93004dcb3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ふっ…！あぁ、臍下丹田に\r\n力を入れていたのです。\r\nこの格好ですと、意識しやすい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a768531718f7a448e073be4821336ce2f5fec6d0a1ed0ce69b968b9383ad7c00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51c8270674a9009b2e42a44c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戦とはその前の準備で勝敗が決まる\r\nものだと、孫子も説いています。\r\nさあ、今日もトレーニングを！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6ebb8386696527b4ede892f8b13bc0a9fd4327dce62e35462119e19980f778e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:221d621f9c0a0d8b99315f58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私の“烈火”は、鞘なき白刃とも\r\n言い換えられましょう。己を制し、\r\n正しく振るうと誓います。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ef71f967f856f699acaaa6b6ebb8d581873512000f1d788662e28efaad52790",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a929377ae8eac8f7cd2c4884",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "身体1つで頂を目指すレース界は\r\nまさしく群雄割拠の戦国が如し！\r\nさあ、勇んで参りましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2899b8d10ad4c1b2f64926e9bb34162831d7d65cb93529aaf3ab014366a50947",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a9a3be82281cd2cb291941b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースにおいてはトレーナー殿が\r\n軍師であらせられる。\r\n私は信じて戦うのみです。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38c43a342eb7325fe2856cac8f05a2ec195460e1409ce0b4738d275ca5ff14cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:142dbf87928f8667f81d5681",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナー殿、参りましょう。\r\n天下への道のりは遠いですが、\r\n貴方とならきっと未来を掴めます。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1405517364c488f109b1d1d89f210d3bece8e623f4515654f2dccd57d6e083b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d4cbcd7d0af73cefbb4c9c0f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーナー殿は、さながら\r\n背中を預けた戦友。おかげさまで\r\n私は前にだけ集中できるのです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f63f0d1f2897df10de2112adac83c78d5086d45b51e61e8555fadb57707715ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a00c123380c36574becdaef9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要是没有你我就无法找到自己的\r\n道路──感谢你的指导！",
      "source_fingerprint": "829d5a79181188a5afaa98c6550dcedd3be4e6234bae9ade93cea74e8320b5df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb42d8c5d0deaaf5debe6d28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "往后我仍会持续挑战「火水合一」！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2eaee83216cd57ea376e79960c47eb8140f294221dcd61322965fa25f6b8aad9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90bd8414fb85030c965f0acd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レースの世界でも頂を取れました！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5622e9cefce1b8aeccc0c1dde73fb545989a7c61c0be1635d13bc8c5c433026a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:729f546eecb8b12916b0e2c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方という援軍あっての成果です！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a0dd2b57d103869e4da93bedebcd52c135af01485c916d50766ba48166bd971",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9876c664a624be00d773893",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是锻炼的成果！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4815d74aa118cd5ffaef1139e36c5353a9d65667e9114fbf6fc4e580f2b53d42",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35c6e6bfbb234b4c63b99836",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心技合一！\r\n往后我也会持续全力精进自己！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f795202d1eac6534c7f8ed31bcc182e22e3732f4016e3252a88902f6d096411d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2415254437cf8bf8329d579b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是八重无敌！喝啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d86d595ea89230ea2d7d7e72eb8bc0396fb7d3b7cf86d50106883c111cc178a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:314e7d037400ffa19f2be547",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "八重绽放的无敌斗志──\r\n出发，迈向自已的道路！",
      "source_fingerprint": "87d01cce683576b867898da37a783c2e139acfdf898d9fb46555b41a5b262980",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bb124c9ec5d263092b26c28",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为更得力的助手！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ef9c4d3ed76c44d5349b447c6d26d019e28be6aca53800e3adc87fbd1cbe9b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4683de7f38a451f3e2ddbf58",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "武学是没有尽头的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6705e2a04f433e839946befb42c44029f71558e9c9fc5482199af245656bb54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bcd7547d7872c62631cec9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "段位が上がったようです！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8fd31719dbb2826af63d1c84e31f4f74015343791afcf3668953a5788e99ebac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04142f1263f0fd9216f17b3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "剣もレースも、限界はない！",
      "source_fingerprint": "03b4dbe0a6e3a7d2e05520ebac00480a9385a572fb383f932b41daa512b4fb7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5edcc9583959420cc576fda2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喝――！迷いも甘えも、\r\n一刀両断いたしましょう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b1e0e005ad672f4b67412af7d6b56309f8231c3fde4ba361156f016134c601c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:751550e561dc337b069d1348",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヤエノムテキ、推して参る！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d246e213ef99773543dda36a3ffb56b74fb83353e35ad83888afde7ca1a52c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1072",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cd51cb94ed392c902c59352",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Let's go!",
      "source_fingerprint": "4455be73df06b0d173582d85f4e48a9d5ab9b02279c6d289e09f5c000e28ca29",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e040d7baf63823d9e733c46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会用你教给我的，\r\n靠谱的方法努力！\r\n为了防止暴走……我会注意的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "11d8f00b023833c1b22d0c1de4e8ad60ff4b58e7b54b26a2a039ae42f5a86141",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5797207fecedc12916d3b79",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3526ad293faaba2bbb60e92f2aa2f0ce80200789aaddb5c16e63e30f50a9723c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59a000a75494ce638741fae5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0911e22207ebd4e5b2465a4d2378a3328e0057ddd0a0764d77344297201735f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9d9eedfac4301b7f1190d77b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "为了成为靠谱的刚志！\r\n我会多多努力成为一个\r\n可靠的人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe9b6d848eaad0af4d257dcd9a5f85463a259d40145a423d4261d9b43c05c2ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b965f2ff3ee2a536fba4321c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这次一定要让训练员吃\r\n『爆肉金刚套餐』，\r\n变得满身肌肉！哦~！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d25e721a44abc92236a6f322eb6d1cf8d3b88aff8e34b1e155055ea3b5d44b39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4389e865a7e4fe00b24d4b0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\r\n今年的目标是『健康第一』\r\n『火力全开』『突破极限』！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d82eab8d3a73a53ed875377a0781a0b9b9cb1cef5a6a92054cc923630a6058c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05ee9812b501d32f084132d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『悄悄做了一些巧克力』\r\n——好！就把这个说给会长听吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "d19f985cd14076b31b4b2d0b3c0343d9bd7c3c97da258c6848db1314f9127105",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bafb3b6d5edf673da55444e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我超级超级、超~级用心地\r\n做了这些充满热情的点心！\r\n请收下这份炽热的心意！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4cd601adc44536df0b73352cac4816d9fde17f9262002ae4b310657b3bed7db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef1b3d053f26733e4f5469a6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想以自己的干劲让天空放晴…！\r\n让织女和牛郎相遇！\r\n呜喔喔！天空，放晴吧——！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa8df30cbda782aba1b6cda6e7754b59df68312ddfc54a18995f74b83ba4d48d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4ab9ae501900ba51d9aeeda0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "托弟弟妹妹的福，\r\n我已经习惯了恶作剧。\r\n不管怎么恶作剧我都没问题！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b743785ec4b7c2b5aff89fa5fa9fdec5b0caae8e74176506caea0d571d5b4382",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc612e6e06152fceb7b7f6ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "给家里的圣诞礼物\r\n应该送到了吧？\r\n大家会喜欢吗~？嘿嘿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6debbce68b0d8ef7bed94c60141bf051ebb32383352a96a8afb4f93713a2ebc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:749ae493a921e78d4996512d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要出门去逛逛吗？\r\n今年想要精神饱满地迎接\r\n新的一天，全力享受当下！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8e7e6c2c7d29f2f6c4a1e12d74d936c37daec3a905511733ffe64ed9c2a57a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2bbba592742a168197daeacc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶~！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b7c0677a83e18888e595c5c3558a426a26a82fa21bee1c8e97470099a4b7d98a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a6a6e686c17fe9c98dddebe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年倒计时绝对\r\n不能睡着！不能倒下！\r\n要和大家一起跨年……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c4fbe73da6851619c3d42156bd8f4130553a69f8eb66641e320700967a0aab6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:99f009a8c1aca4afe7b5a52f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐！\r\n就让我大师・刚志来为你\r\n热烈庆祝吧~♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "070a919bcde463dea0fb189b83dacc353308f2b578aaeedb41e126fd30d9c4cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:836275ca356208049b73f17a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『破天爆裂健康香草茶』和\r\n『古今无双超大份蛋糕』\r\n已经准备好了！快尽情享用吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3fe5439f1348494b1cd1072d582bc9531adddf6fddf486927e45126fab1c30b2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21174fe7d1ce276b693a012f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "居然收到了这么多礼物～…！\r\n为了回报大家的温柔，\r\n我要变得更强！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37b1ab2043761fdaaa3b83961fa3f8f33031d5b1bf8d189d0dd75211ee9035e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adf0fd02c4da1af4a77906a3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想做的事，吗？那就让我来\r\n帮训练员！……诶，不行吗？\r\n就通融一下嘛……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8ace159bf0fdb318c1784c1c31aab96111ffec96e0bd74c79c0c767db8e8619f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c91bc14f2298d68264724cb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有通知来了。\r\n一起去看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5016b628541211b7c742cb60dee713be6b907bf0e051463a6a69142c383a4735",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23df0fa11aeb0eca9d914794",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "有礼物送到了哦！\r\n赶紧来打开看看吧♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "63bd6c1d1ead14e78d4d7fb66d81cf79d81b333f3b983473d1c934ed729e7448",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:147e0a0a0ec47fc492cdd1c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦哦~任务完成了！\r\n我也得加油了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "131c1c6eff347a1a039404a026850066cf7e2086151894c3b78578e74decbcad",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6ab55037704155e0e08a461",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动就快开始了！\r\n得赶紧调理好身体……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "144e0c1d662be96c33438a7f91f215b77045c89217c74c76545e4cb259fcf6ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:050a6353a39348d37ac22e26",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动开始了！\r\n那就精神满满地Let's go！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7b961ad773bdb05d8685137288b16c4fbd02473338269a68aa36cce5a5a842a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:207bd0302f8bc6f2a2e9d94e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我没有任何不甘心……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f07d6794e36d878c66cad4b72c54adbb04ee94cb18b905e1c4ac31eb341e449",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20f80b86fef4e76237437c42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "图鉴等级上升了！\r\n务必务必去看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b972d50406ecf10e3996cf256f08e3cb0a1b9b4899e951fd11e1f18e9a34078",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3db1638d75dc9906fbbfe07f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不管去哪里外套都是必需的！\n要是不能保证体温的话\n会很难受的……啊哈哈。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61a6209a00426fb825aeaa928a5cb927894d95da6354506ef4880c56bede4b03",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfb79b93169d0f223dea90e6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿靴子的话脚就不冷了很舒服呢～\n然后只要注意别闷着脚就行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d45a0037993eed6518cb896e9493390d974d51a4e0b1678ac4c0b81f645c7d10",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b19aca7ca4ab9c9812f3dbfd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "稍微试了一下会长的黑色内搭……\n果然成熟又帅气呢。诶嘿嘿♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f1d7e4faef2a1fcb307fbe112d9c426a8d4dec06062a2978bc2d29de0df10b7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a32ac0db4dddfa4a1cbf25b4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家也都很厉害啊……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "40c6015990ac00091fea617f62ba87124eb7ecc182f149151057c0f35a0ddb48",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1073",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d751f146d71d5d38f46f502f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是努力得来的成果呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f61292f5fb1ee938c05aa7ec878da35100078a4c2e14fbd14cd5b4ebd16e4dc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
